[
    {
        "id": "f3",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Orchestrator Pipeline",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "# Orchestrator Pipeline Flow\n\nThis flow demonstrates the AlephScript Orchestrator node acting as a central message routing hub:\n\n- **Message Routing**: Routes messages between different channels\n- **Pipeline Processing**: Transforms and processes messages in sequence\n- **Cross-Channel Communication**: Enables communication between App, Sys, and UI channels\n- **Stream Management**: Manages RxJS observables for reactive processing",
        "env": []
    },
    {
        "id": "orchestrator1",
        "type": "alephscript-orchestrator",
        "z": "f3",
        "name": "Message Hub",
        "serverUrl": "http://localhost:3000",
        "namespace": "/runtime",
        "routingRules": [
            {
                "from": "app",
                "to": "sys",
                "condition": "error"
            },
            {
                "from": "sys",
                "to": "ui",
                "condition": "status_update"
            }
        ],
        "enablePipeline": true,
        "x": 400,
        "y": 200,
        "wires": [
            ["debug-orchestrator", "route-processor"]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "bot3",
        "type": "alephscript-enhanced-bot",
        "z": "f3",
        "name": "Pipeline Bot",
        "botName": "PipelineBot",
        "serverUrl": "http://localhost:3000",
        "namespace": "/runtime",
        "autoConnect": true,
        "features": ["CLIENT_REGISTER", "ROOM_MANAGEMENT", "ORCHESTRATION"],
        "x": 150,
        "y": 120,
        "wires": [
            ["orchestrator1"]
        ]
    },
